## Architecture boundary

Qwen2.5 uses pre-attention RMSNorm → attention → output projection → residual → post-attention RMSNorm → MLP → residual. The post-attention norm and MLP are intentionally not implemented in this checkpoint. No NEON, Vulkan, QNN/NPU, MoE, routing, LM head, generation, or production Android inference has been added.
